  </introduction>

  <subsection xml:id="office-hours">
    <title>Office Hours</title>

    <p>
      Office hours are held in <alert>Heafey 103</alert> on Mondays,
      Wednesdays, and Fridays from 2:15 to 3:45 PM. You do not need an
      appointment to come to office hours; just drop in.
    </p>

    <figure xml:id="fig-office-hours">
      <caption>Office hours are for questions, worked examples, and thinking
      out loud together.</caption>
      <image source="office-hours-discussion.png" width="80%">
        <shortdescription>An instructor at a whiteboard explaining a surface to three students around a table</shortdescription>
        <description>
          <p>
            A cartoon of an instructor standing at a whiteboard, pointing with
            a marker at a sketch of a surface in three-dimensional coordinate
            axes with a red arrow rising from a point on it. Three students sit
            around a round table in front of the whiteboard, taking notes in
            spiral notebooks, with a laptop, a mug, books, and a potted plant
            on the table. Everyone looks engaged and is talking.
          </p>
        </description>
      </image>
    </figure>

